{"repositoryId":1219956035,"availability":"available","full":"Sohila-Khaled-Abbas/global-horizon-bank-dwh-project","name":"global-horizon-bank-dwh-project","description":"This repository contains the complete architecture and implementation of a data system for Global Horizon Bank. Following industry best practices, the project transitions from a highly normalized Transactional Database (OLTP) to a high-performance dimensional Data Warehouse (OLAP), capable of answering complex business questions at scale.","category":"Business","language":"Python","stars":0,"forks":1,"created":"2026-04-24T11:51:34Z","updated":"2026-05-03T11:35:29Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://global-horizon-bank-dwh-project.streamlit.app/","topics":["banking","docker","dwh","etl","olap","oltp","python","sql","streamlit","t-sql"],"demo":"https://global-horizon-bank-dwh-project.streamlit.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T18:15:54.866Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-18T18:15:54.866Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-18T18:15:54.866Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-12T09:46:59.556Z","stars":0,"forks":1},{"at":"2026-10-18T18:15:54.866Z","stars":0,"forks":1}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["End-to-End Banking Data Intelligence Architecture"],"features":["Executive KPIs: Real-time monitoring of Transactions, Volume, Average Ticket, Active Accounts, and Weekend Share with period-over-period deltas.","Localized Context: Specifically tailored for the Egyptian banking sector, including Governorate-level analysis (Cairo, Giza, Alexandria, Dakahlia, etc.).","Loan Portfolio Analytics: Dedicated module for tracking loan types, status distribution, and portfolio age.","Intelligent Recommendations: A rule-based engine that identifies risks (branch concentration, momentum shifts) and premium growth opportunities.","Dynamic Controls: Switch between Volume ($) and Transaction Count, adjust time grains (Year/Quarter/Month), and f